# Regexes, one per line, for added lines the shared Leak Gate should not flag.
# Matched against "<line number>:<path>: <added text>".
#
# The Privacy Guard tests build private-looking fixtures on purpose (synthetic
# hosts and addresses, split in the source so the files do not match the tree
# denylist). Nothing in them is real.
^[0-9]+:scripts/test-(check-commit-emails|privacy-denylist)\.sh:
